# Privacy Policy for VFit

**Last Updated:** September 16, 2026

VFit ("VFit", "we", "our", or "us") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information.

This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect information when you use the VFit mobile application and related services.

By using VFit, you agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.

## 1. Information We Collect

Depending on how you use VFit, we may collect the following categories of information:

### 1.1 Account Information

If you create an account or use account-related features, we may collect information such as:

* Name
* Email address
* Phone number
* Password or authentication information
* Profile information
* Account preferences

### 1.2 Shopping and Order Information

When you browse or purchase products through VFit, we may collect information necessary to process your order, such as:

* Products you purchase
* Order details
* Delivery address
* Contact information
* Order history
* Payment-related information

Payment information may be processed by third-party payment service providers. VFit may not directly store complete payment card information.

### 1.3 Photos and Images

VFit may allow you to upload or capture images for certain features, including our AI-powered virtual try-on experience.

For example, you may:

* Select or upload a photo of a person.
* Take a photo using your device camera.
* Upload an image of a clothing item.
* Select a clothing item from the VFit catalog.
* Submit images for AI-powered virtual clothing visualization.

Images submitted for the virtual try-on feature may be processed by VFit and/or service providers that help us provide the AI functionality.

We use these images only as necessary to provide, maintain, secure, and improve the requested feature, subject to applicable law and the terms of the service.

### 1.4 Camera Access

VFit may request access to your device camera when you choose to take a photo for features such as the AI-powered virtual try-on experience.

Camera access is requested only when you use a feature that requires it.

VFit does not access your camera continuously or record video in the background.

### 1.5 Device and Technical Information

We may automatically collect certain technical information when you use the application, including:

* Device type and model
* Operating system and version
* Application version
* Device identifiers where permitted
* IP address
* Language and general regional settings
* Crash reports
* Diagnostic and performance information

This information may be used to maintain application security, diagnose technical problems, and improve application performance.

### 1.6 Usage Information

We may collect information about how you interact with VFit, such as:

* Pages or screens viewed
* Products viewed
* Features used
* Search activity
* General interaction with the application
* Errors and performance events

This information helps us understand how VFit is used and improve our services.

## 2. How We Use Your Information

We may use collected information to:

* Create and manage your account.
* Provide and operate VFit services.
* Display products and product information.
* Process and manage orders.
* Arrange delivery of purchased products.
* Provide customer support.
* Provide the AI-powered virtual try-on experience.
* Process uploaded images when you request AI visualization.
* Improve application functionality and performance.
* Detect, prevent, and investigate fraud or misuse.
* Maintain the security of our application and services.
* Comply with legal and regulatory requirements.
* Communicate with you about your account, orders, or services.

## 3. AI-Powered Virtual Try-On

VFit includes an AI-powered feature that allows users to visualize clothing on a selected person or image.

The feature may allow you to select a person image and select a clothing item, or upload an image of a clothing item, and generate a visualization showing how the clothing may appear on the selected person.

### Important Information About AI Processing

The AI-generated result is intended for visualization and shopping assistance only.

The generated image may not accurately represent the actual fit, size, shape, color, material, or appearance of a product.

Images submitted to the AI feature may be temporarily processed and stored as necessary to generate the requested result and operate the service.

We may use third-party technology providers to process images and generate AI results where necessary to provide this feature.

Users should only upload images that they have the right or permission to use.

## 4. How We Share Information

We do not sell your personal information as a standalone product.

We may share information with trusted third-party service providers when necessary to operate VFit, such as providers for:

* Cloud hosting and storage
* AI image processing
* Payment processing
* Order fulfillment and delivery
* Analytics and crash reporting
* Customer support
* Security and fraud prevention
* Authentication services

These providers may process information only as necessary to provide services to us and are expected to maintain appropriate security and confidentiality.

We may also disclose information when required by law, legal process, court order, or governmental request, or when necessary to protect the rights, safety, and security of VFit, our users, or others.

## 5. Payment Information

VFit may provide payment options for purchasing products.

Payments may be processed through third-party payment providers. When you make a payment, the payment provider may collect and process payment information according to its own privacy policy and terms.

VFit does not necessarily receive or store your complete payment card details.

## 6. Data Retention

We retain personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary to provide our services, maintain business and transaction records, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, prevent fraud, and enforce our agreements.

Images uploaded for AI-powered features may be retained only for the period necessary to provide the requested service and related technical purposes, unless a longer retention period is required by law or otherwise disclosed to you.

Retention periods may vary depending on the type of information and the purpose for which it was collected.

## 7. Data Security

We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, loss, or misuse.

However, no internet transmission or electronic storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.

